  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding Burundi&#x2019;s Humanitarian, Early Recovery and Emergency Response for Vulnerable Displaced Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address the current gaps in humanitarian emergency response in Burundi by reinforcing an Emergency Event Tracking system for rapid alert assessment following natural disasters and other displacement events and by implementing a comprehensive emergency response programme, including the provision of shelter, non-food items and water, sanitation and hygiene support for vulnerable displaced populations.  Lastly the project implements small grants mechanism aimed at conflict prevention and peace building. The project will contribute towards strengthening the humanitarian development peacebuilding nexus by combining immediate response with early recovery approaches for both direct beneficiaries and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
